            { type: "p", text: "Wichtige Zerlegungsmuster (Umkehrung der Sonderfälle):" },
            { type: "code", text: "a² − b²          = (a + b)(a − b)\na² + 2ab + b²    = (a + b)²\na² − 2ab + b²    = (a − b)²\na³ + b³          = (a + b)(a² − ab + b²)\na³ − b³          = (a − b)(a² + ab + b²)\nax + ay + bx + by = a(x + y) + b(x + y) = (a + b)(x + y)" }
